# Public keys that sign FEx releases (minisign). Builds trust these, and
# only these, to install updates. One base64 key per line; lines starting
# with '#' are comments.
#
# To rotate: add the new key here, ship a release signed with the old key
# (so installed copies learn the new one), then sign with the new key and
# remove the old line in a later release.
#
# No key yet: until one is added, builds refuse to install updates.
